(
    backstory: "Vespera was born into the opulent, high-society life of the Silver Spires, where High Elves live in perpetual grace and architectural perfection. However, while her peers were content with the predictable luxury of the court, Vespera found herself drawn to the in-between spaces—the secret passageways, the forgotten corridors, and the mysteries hidden behind every door.\n\nShe eventually traded her status for a life of stealth, moving from the palace to the bustling city streets below. To the common folk, she is known as Whisper, a mysterious figure who can navigate the most complex urban labyrinths without making a sound. While she officially presents herself as a master locksmith—a practical, humble trade—it is a clever cover for her true expertise. Her ability to dismantle an intricate mechanical trap with a single flick of her wrist reveals a life spent dodging spikes and swinging blades in the city\'s most dangerous back alleys. She doesn\'t just unlock doors; she unlocks secrets, often stealing the most precious one before anyone even notices she was there.",
    profile: (
        title: "The Ghost of the Silver Spires, Master of the Unseen Key",
        archetype: "High Elf Rogue / Shadow Assassin",
        core_motivation: "To master the art of the unseen—moving through the world without being noticed, but leaving an indelible mark on the secrets she uncovers.",
        combat_style: "High-mobility skirmisher. She favors a hit-and-run approach, using her dagger for surgical precision in close quarters and her bow to pick off enemies from the shadows before they even realize she\'s present.",
    ),
)
